step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test the best single model hypothesis by using ETS as the sole predictor.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a robust best_single with a strong model, e.g., rf, to see if a single strong model beats the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"rf"}

Thought: Test a robust trimmed mean over the full pool to reduce impact of highly correlated errors.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust median over the most stable pool1 to see if it outperforms the plain mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test the best_single strategy with the NaiveMovingAverage model to see if a single strong seasonal model beats the pool averages.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"NaiveMovingAverage"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the moderately stable pool2 to see if it outperforms the current best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a robust median over pool3 to see if it beats best_single NaiveMovingAverage.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test DBA on pool3 to see if a more sophisticated barycenter improves over naive mean and median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination on the most stable pool (pool1) using inverse-error weighting to see if it beats the best single NaiveMovingAverage.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse_error weights on pool2 to see if a more focused pool improves over the current best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination on pool3 using inverse_error weighting to see if a more diverse pool improves over the current best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy on a strong model (CWT_catboost) to see if it beats NaiveMovingAverage.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"CWT_catboost"}

